  "name": "Original document notification",
  "version": "HL7 v2.5.1",
  "chapter": "Medical Records/Information Management",
  "description": "This is a notification of a cancellation of a document.   This trigger event should be used only for an original document with an availability status of “Unavailable.”  When a document has been made available for patient care, the process should be to replace the original document, which then becomes obsolete.  The replacement document describes why the erroneous information exists.",
